// The namespaces whose directory under api/ holds only other directories, so no header there
// can describe them. Every other namespace is described above its opening in a header.

/**
 * @namespace v3d
 * The Vertical3D api. Each library is a namespace under this one, named for its directory under
 * api/.
 **/

/**
 * @namespace v3d::font
 * Fonts: faces opened through FreeType, their glyphs, text shaped and laid out in them, and faces
 * drawn into a texture atlas.
 **/

/**
 * @namespace v3d::render
 * The renderers: the Vulkan realtime renderer an app draws with, and the offline renderer moya is
 * built on.
 **/

/**
 * @namespace v3d::render::realtime::vulkan
 * The Vulkan objects the realtime renderer is built from: the device, the frames in flight,
 * memory, and pipelines.
 **/
